<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs steady higher after German Ifo Index.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs steady higher after German Ifo Index.</headline>
<text>
<p>0810 GMT - Belgian OLOs hold light gains after Ifo index shows slight rise in West German business sentiment in May. Ifo sees German 1997 deficit at 3.2 pct GDP. Bund touch higher.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.78% (5.80) BE286=,  8 bps over Bunds (unch) MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.08 at 122.22 BGBc1 ;Mark/Bfr 20.6345/55(20.6342/47)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.23/26% (unch), 1-wk repo 3.26/28 (26/30)  TTFBXL</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
